    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11430" root="خلو" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخْلٍ</span></b> , and its fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخْلِيَةٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَالٍ</span>, in six
places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسْتُ لَكَ بِمُخْلِيَةٍ</span>, occurring in a trad.,
means <i>I did not find thee destitute of wives
beside me</i>: it is not from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِمْرَأَةٌ مُخْلِيَةٌ</span> signifying
“ a woman having no husband. ” (TA.)

